# Origin of a deployed Yahoo CORS proxy (Vercel app or Cloudflare Worker).
# Used so GitHub Pages can request Live charts. Leave unset on Vercel itself
# (same-origin /api/yahoo is used). Do not include a trailing slash.
# Example: https://markets-dashboard.vercel.app
# VITE_YAHOO_PROXY_BASE=https://markets-dashboard.vercel.app
